{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7663431116440029450","title":"深度学习算法工程师（数据生成方向）-2027校招","description":"1、负责图像、视频、3D内容⽣成算法，包括但不限于VAE/GAN、Diffusion、NeRF、3DGS等相关算法前沿技术跟进和研发落地；\n2、深⼊下游应⽤场景，结合场景重建、神经渲染、生成式AI等为算法提供可用于训练/评估的高质量数据，支持高级智能感知系统的研发落地；\n3、探索大规模图像数据自动生成: AIGC、DiffusionModel、3DGS 、World Model等技术研发和业务落地。","requirement":"1、硕士及以上学历，模式识别、计算机视觉、数学、电子信息等相关专业优先；\n2、能够熟练使用Tensorflow/Pytorch中的一种或多种深度学习框架，熟练使用Python；\n3、熟悉多视角几何、三维重建、生成式模型相关算法理论知识；\n4、具备相关领域工程背景：在无人机、自动驾驶、机器人相关的重建算法(包括Diffusion Model、NeRF、ControlNet、3DGS)中的一个或多个领域有过研究和项目经历优先；\n5、有过相关领域的顶级会议论文发表(CVPR、 ICCV、ECCV等)或在相关领域的学术竞赛中取得较好成绩者优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784281819938,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7663431116439832842","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}